description "IG-86 Sentinel Droid

A mass produced assassin droid.

^2Weaponry:
- Heavy Melee
- Cyroban Grenade (1)

^8Attributes:
- 10% faster hacking
- 10% less knockback taken
- Recharge (2)
-- Regen: 10/10s
- Strength (1)
- Elemental Resist (1)
- Beskar (2)
- Mag Plating
- Assemble (3)
- Blast Armor
- Melee Resist
- Armor Regen (1)
- Anti-Mind Trick (1)
- Tracking Beacon"